WEBVTT

01:41.430 --> 01:45.930
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.620 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 28]

02:01.200 --> 02:01.790
Ranran.

02:02.920 --> 02:03.680
Master.

02:04.310 --> 02:05.920
You've ascended to the Transcendence Realm.

02:14.960 --> 02:16.360
Your Formless Spirit Root is gone.

02:18.010 --> 02:22.950
♫Fallen leaves swirling and covering the empty garden♫

02:20.840 --> 02:21.750
It's not that bad.

02:22.360 --> 02:23.780
I can still concoct and refine pills.

02:24.430 --> 02:24.910
Besides,

02:24.780 --> 02:30.070
♫Clouds and dust rolling in the distant sky♫

02:25.240 --> 02:26.750
I haven't lost my skill with talismans.

02:27.150 --> 02:28.400
Even though I can't cultivate with the Spirit Root anymore,

02:28.750 --> 02:30.190
I can try the path of talisman cultivation.

02:31.280 --> 02:32.430
Anyway, until the very end,

02:31.460 --> 02:34.470
♫Generations of dreams fold into one♫

02:32.960 --> 02:34.030
let's not give up,

02:34.520 --> 02:35.079
okay?

02:34.920 --> 02:37.470
♫Solitary branches hidden in clothing♫

02:35.870 --> 02:36.750
You're still

02:37.310 --> 02:38.190
so willful and reckless.

02:38.290 --> 02:44.720
♫Extend fate to call you back; How lucky to meet by chance♫

02:38.800 --> 02:39.470
Master.

02:40.800 --> 02:41.470
Are you crying?

02:45.310 --> 02:50.650
♫I've shed thousands of tears, but my feelings haven't run dry♫

02:46.870 --> 02:47.430
From now on,

02:48.630 --> 02:49.630
I will protect you well.

02:52.180 --> 02:57.540
♫Hatred adds grayness to my hair♫

02:54.240 --> 02:55.800
Master, you were once deceived by me

02:56.120 --> 02:56.960
and driven to Mount Wester.

02:57.520 --> 02:58.590
You were bullied so badly,

02:58.630 --> 02:59.560
yet you never cried.

02:58.720 --> 03:01.880
♫Which side does destiny choose?♫

03:00.520 --> 03:01.310
Are you recalling things?

03:01.840 --> 03:02.910
Only a few

03:02.150 --> 03:05.270
♫Demon or immortal?♫

03:03.680 --> 03:04.400
trivial things

03:04.560 --> 03:06.310
when we were back in Mount Wester.

03:05.680 --> 03:11.330
♫With you by my side, I'm fearless in the face of life's hardships♫

03:07.560 --> 03:08.400
Back then, Master,

03:08.870 --> 03:10.280
you weren't as gentle as you are now.

03:12.530 --> 03:15.800
♫If love wants me to die♫

03:13.560 --> 03:14.910
If you remember more in the future,

03:15.520 --> 03:16.800
or even recall Su Yu,

03:16.390 --> 03:19.300
♫We'll be together again when the flowers bloom♫

03:18.120 --> 03:18.750
you'll know that

03:19.590 --> 03:20.910
you were originally on his side.

03:19.630 --> 03:26.310
♫The moment between us is worth 10,000 years♫

03:21.310 --> 03:22.460
And I only disappointed you.

03:23.400 --> 03:24.079
I'm afraid you might...

03:24.240 --> 03:25.400
Even so, I won't regret it.

03:26.000 --> 03:27.710
I don't remember much about the past,

03:28.470 --> 03:29.360
and I can't

03:29.630 --> 03:30.630
speak on behalf of my past self

03:31.120 --> 03:32.430
to say things like forgiving you

03:32.750 --> 03:33.400
or not blaming you,

03:33.680 --> 03:34.800
words to comfort you.

03:35.430 --> 03:37.190
But I can see my own heart clearly,

03:38.190 --> 03:38.960
and I'm certain of

03:39.310 --> 03:40.520
my current feelings.

03:42.150 --> 03:44.079
I remember every time you protected me, Master,

03:44.910 --> 03:46.750
and every time you were tough on the outside but soft on the inside.

03:47.050 --> 03:52.390
♫I've shed thousands of tears, but my feelings haven't run dry♫

03:47.560 --> 03:48.590
I like you, Master,

03:49.520 --> 03:50.630
truly and sincerely.

03:51.150 --> 03:51.910
I also hope

03:52.310 --> 03:53.560
to be with you for a long time.

03:53.930 --> 03:59.280
♫Hatred adds grayness to my hair♫

03:55.400 --> 03:56.910
If I remember everything in the future,

03:57.520 --> 03:58.680
we'll talk about it then.

03:59.520 --> 04:00.000
After all,

04:00.440 --> 04:01.720
it's my own decision to make,

04:00.460 --> 04:03.620
♫Which side does destiny choose?♫

04:01.750 --> 04:02.280
isn't it?

04:02.960 --> 04:03.430
Worst case scenario,

04:03.890 --> 04:07.010
♫Demon or immortal?♫

04:03.910 --> 04:04.710
we'll have a fight.

04:06.870 --> 04:07.710
You've lost all your spiritual power.

04:07.420 --> 04:13.070
♫With you by my side, I'm fearless in the face of life's hardships♫

04:07.870 --> 04:08.360
How should you fight?

04:09.800 --> 04:12.280
Then you can tie yourself up

04:12.710 --> 04:13.750
and let me give you a good beating, Master.

04:14.280 --> 04:17.540
♫If love wants me to die♫

04:18.089 --> 04:21.149
♫I won't give up because of you♫

04:20.120 --> 04:22.560
We've wasted a lot of time

04:21.170 --> 04:23.090
♫Thousands of steps to cross the sky-high chasm♫

04:22.560 --> 04:24.240
which should have been beautiful in the past.

04:23.110 --> 04:27.130
♫Reincarnation and fate can't be denied♫

04:25.310 --> 04:25.830
Now,

04:26.510 --> 04:27.950
let's not hesitate anymore

04:27.150 --> 04:31.230
♫Why does the world have everything but love?♫

04:29.040 --> 04:30.160
and miss every moment.

04:31.160 --> 04:31.630
Okay.

04:31.720 --> 04:34.700
♫Falling forever is like becoming immortal♫

04:35.200 --> 04:41.320
♫I insist to be with you day after day♫

04:38.560 --> 04:39.040
From now on,

04:40.040 --> 04:41.360
no matter what happens,

04:42.270 --> 04:43.430
we'll face it together.

04:43.830 --> 04:44.890
Neither of us should easily

04:44.920 --> 04:45.920
let go of the other's hand,

04:46.750 --> 04:47.430
okay?

04:48.630 --> 04:49.070
Okay.

04:55.520 --> 05:05.280
♫The moment between us is worth 10,000 years♫

05:20.360 --> 05:21.160
You may leave now.

05:23.430 --> 05:24.070
Yes.

05:34.360 --> 05:35.000
Your Highness.

05:40.310 --> 05:42.120
You said it was foolproof.

05:44.920 --> 05:46.480
Am I dying?

05:49.750 --> 05:50.600
Your Highness.

05:51.190 --> 05:53.030
You're indeed showing a sign of depleted primordial spirit.

05:53.550 --> 05:55.340
There's not enough time to find another suitable person.

05:56.120 --> 05:57.120
This plan

05:57.630 --> 05:59.270
was disrupted by the Spirit Spring and the Green Dragon.

06:00.040 --> 06:01.270
It was truly unexpected.

06:16.050 --> 06:16.930
Why?

06:21.290 --> 06:22.360
Why, even after starting over,

06:22.390 --> 06:24.170
did she still choose Su Yishui?

06:27.550 --> 06:29.920
After all these years of careful planning,

06:31.080 --> 06:32.880
nothing has changed.

06:44.380 --> 06:45.580
I don't want to die.

06:47.070 --> 06:47.560
No.

06:48.020 --> 06:49.260
I can't die!

06:51.480 --> 06:52.870
You must have another way, right?

06:56.360 --> 06:57.390
Think of something quickly.

06:57.950 --> 06:59.600
I can't let Su Yishui escape!

07:04.630 --> 07:05.270
Get out!

07:09.120 --> 07:10.040
Guards!

07:11.960 --> 07:13.110
Guards, come quickly!

07:32.800 --> 07:35.240
At first, the plan was going smoothly.

07:35.920 --> 07:38.480
From the moment Su Yishui had the Spirit Spring with him,

07:38.870 --> 07:40.480
I had already started to make arrangements

07:40.920 --> 07:43.480
to have Su Yu lead Su Yishui into the palace,

07:43.950 --> 07:44.830
so that I could take the opportunity

07:45.120 --> 07:47.800
to let the Spirit Spring return to the Demon's child's body.

07:48.720 --> 07:49.390
Now,

07:49.800 --> 07:50.870
I'm not sure if the Spirit Spring

07:51.430 --> 07:53.120
has already firmly attached itself

07:53.240 --> 07:54.630
to Su Yishui's body.

07:55.390 --> 07:55.920
However,

07:56.480 --> 07:57.240
rest assured.

07:57.720 --> 08:00.000
I will keep a close eye on Su Yishui's movements.

08:00.750 --> 08:02.680
I will make sure you can return as soon as possible

08:02.950 --> 08:04.190
to take control of everything.

08:07.480 --> 08:09.310
Xue Ranran is actually Mu Qingge?

08:10.600 --> 08:11.040
Yes.

08:16.040 --> 08:17.390
Interesting.

08:18.830 --> 08:20.210
I've been saying all along that Mu Qingge

08:20.240 --> 08:21.240
was very suspicious.

08:22.000 --> 08:23.430
That little girl Xue Ranran

08:23.720 --> 08:25.190
is indeed quite to my liking.

08:27.010 --> 08:28.610
So this was the truth all along.

08:29.870 --> 08:30.690
Su Yishui

08:30.720 --> 08:32.080
is truly the most cunning and deceitful of them all.

08:33.240 --> 08:33.960
You just said

08:34.429 --> 08:35.480
the dragon carried them

08:35.510 --> 08:36.440
out to sea?

08:39.280 --> 08:40.240
The far reaches of the East Sea

08:40.340 --> 08:41.390
is the Sea of Immortality.

08:42.090 --> 08:43.090
Within it lies the Divine Dragon Island,

08:43.390 --> 08:44.620
which should be where the Green Dragon is returning to.

08:45.630 --> 08:46.670
But the Divine Dragon Island is hard to reach.

08:47.600 --> 08:49.510
I'm afraid it'll be difficult to track Su Yishui's whereabouts.

08:53.790 --> 08:55.070
They will have to come ashore eventually.

08:55.750 --> 08:57.390
Go immediately and guard the sea entrance.

08:58.960 --> 09:00.550
As for the Spirit Spring and Mu Qingge,

09:01.390 --> 09:03.270
no matter how well you hide them, Su Yishui,

09:04.500 --> 09:05.860
they'll eventually fall

09:06.000 --> 09:06.960
into my hands.

09:11.110 --> 09:12.080
My Lord, hold on!

09:15.550 --> 09:16.270
Tu Jiuyuan.

09:17.000 --> 09:18.640
You're really going to rebel, aren't you?

09:24.020 --> 09:25.630
I will always be loyal to you, My Lord,

09:26.510 --> 09:27.670
and will certainly help you

09:27.910 --> 09:28.660
obtain the Spirit Spring

09:29.200 --> 09:30.120
to cleanse the Blazing Sword

09:30.440 --> 09:31.910
and fulfill your lifelong wish.

09:32.550 --> 09:33.910
I just hope that you, My Lord,

09:34.360 --> 09:35.360
will act calmly.

09:37.790 --> 09:38.670
Calmly?

09:42.750 --> 09:43.750
Times have changed.

09:44.210 --> 09:45.490
Obsessing over Mu Qingge

09:46.400 --> 09:47.070
is pointless now.

09:54.390 --> 09:55.360
Tu Jiuyuan.

09:56.360 --> 09:58.000
Who gave you the courage

09:58.170 --> 10:00.290
to interfere with my personal affairs?

10:01.960 --> 10:03.720
Su Yishui is a madman who, for Mu Qingge's sake,

10:03.980 --> 10:05.450
didn't hesitate to defy the Heavenly Sect

10:06.450 --> 10:07.750
and destroy his own Golden Core

10:07.780 --> 10:09.940
to resurrect Mu Qingge.

10:11.390 --> 10:13.080
It's better to avoid unnecessary trouble.

10:15.630 --> 10:16.720
My taking the Spirit Spring

10:17.060 --> 10:18.420
was always meant to be a confrontation

10:18.440 --> 10:19.480
with Su Yishui to the very end.

10:20.260 --> 10:21.980
What harm is there in snatching Mu Qingge as well?

10:23.910 --> 10:25.320
Do you think I fear Su Yishui,

10:25.320 --> 10:26.720
that black-hearted fox?

10:33.170 --> 10:34.200
Could it be...

10:36.870 --> 10:37.630
What are you panicking about?

10:39.360 --> 10:40.320
With this expression,

10:41.600 --> 10:42.720
I almost thought

10:43.270 --> 10:44.750
you had fallen in love with me

10:45.120 --> 10:46.630
and were getting jealous here.

10:48.630 --> 10:49.080
So what

10:49.870 --> 10:50.870
if I was?

10:56.120 --> 10:57.240
Last time I offered you a title,

10:57.260 --> 10:57.890
you didn't want it,

10:58.040 --> 10:58.960
and you treated it as a joke.

10:59.750 --> 11:00.510
And now, you suddenly...

11:00.530 --> 11:01.480
What I want is certainly not

11:01.480 --> 11:02.260
these things.

11:04.840 --> 11:06.720
What do you mean by "these things"?

11:07.320 --> 11:08.250
Don't you understand, My Lord?

11:15.270 --> 11:17.030
What I want is just a sincere heart.

11:27.000 --> 11:27.360
You...

11:27.380 --> 11:28.310
Indeed, I

11:30.240 --> 11:31.120
have had feelings for you

11:32.660 --> 11:33.660
since much earlier, My Lord.

11:35.870 --> 11:37.080
That moment when we

11:37.080 --> 11:37.790
fought side by side,

11:39.040 --> 11:39.880
that's when I fell for you.

11:40.080 --> 11:40.600
Shut up.

11:42.320 --> 11:43.670
What a ridiculous story.

11:44.090 --> 11:45.110
You think I'd believe that?

11:45.870 --> 11:46.790
I don't remember

11:46.990 --> 11:48.600
any moment of us fighting together.

11:49.270 --> 11:50.790
You and I are born enemies.

11:51.120 --> 11:52.750
There's only ever been clear victory or defeat between us.

11:53.630 --> 11:54.670
Are you joking with me,

11:55.440 --> 11:56.440
or are you dreaming?

12:01.960 --> 12:02.750
It's you who has forgotten.

12:05.080 --> 12:06.030
In earlier times,

12:07.000 --> 12:09.120
we often practiced martial arts and swordsmanship together.

12:10.030 --> 12:10.670
You even said

12:11.180 --> 12:12.680
that when Mount Red Flame opens,

12:13.450 --> 12:15.260
you'd make me the master of Butterfly Valley.

12:29.960 --> 12:31.940
What ancient history are you talking about?

12:33.000 --> 12:33.930
Once I obtain the Spirit Spring,

12:34.260 --> 12:35.120
cleanse the Blazing Sword,

12:35.120 --> 12:36.080
and open Mount Red Flame,

12:36.910 --> 12:38.120
I can grant you the Butterfly Valley

12:38.480 --> 12:39.000
if you wish.

12:40.720 --> 12:41.240
As long as

12:41.870 --> 12:42.720
you stop having those

12:42.740 --> 12:43.830
far-fetched dreams.

12:44.960 --> 12:45.670
Put away your

12:45.690 --> 12:46.690
inexplicable thoughts.

12:48.200 --> 12:49.200
Stay by my side

12:50.600 --> 12:51.630
and do what you're supposed to do.

13:07.970 --> 13:08.730
Elder.

13:09.790 --> 13:10.750
Please sit down.

13:17.270 --> 13:19.000
Elder, do you know about your physical condition?

13:20.030 --> 13:21.320
Elder, you are already pregnant.

13:29.390 --> 13:30.270
It was that time...

13:32.160 --> 13:32.750
My Lord.

13:34.150 --> 13:35.000
You're drunk.

13:37.070 --> 13:37.820
Where do you think you are going?

13:49.480 --> 13:49.840
You...

13:50.100 --> 13:50.950
Why are you here?

13:53.200 --> 13:55.000
I no longer wish to be entangled with him,

13:56.900 --> 13:58.100
yet I'm burdened with this child.

13:59.390 --> 14:00.600
Elder, what do you mean by that?

14:01.200 --> 14:03.120
You mustn't bear this burden alone anymore.

14:03.460 --> 14:05.000
You must let Sovereign know about this.

14:06.420 --> 14:07.850
What's the point of letting him know?

14:10.120 --> 14:11.240
I just humiliated myself

14:11.260 --> 14:12.490
by confessing my feelings to him.

14:13.320 --> 14:14.800
I was mocked and ridiculed.

14:15.880 --> 14:18.760
How could I force him to acknowledge this child?

14:20.630 --> 14:22.510
It would only bring me more shame.

14:23.080 --> 14:24.200
But if you don't tell him,

14:24.750 --> 14:26.480
when the baby grows bigger and your pregnancy becomes visible,

14:27.080 --> 14:28.510
it can't be hidden anyway.

14:32.240 --> 14:33.000
At worst,

14:33.510 --> 14:34.870
after helping him obtain the Spirit Spring,

14:35.870 --> 14:37.080
cleanse the Blazing Sword,

14:37.150 --> 14:38.480
and open Mount Red Flame,

14:39.960 --> 14:41.790
fulfilling my vow to the old sovereign,

14:44.510 --> 14:46.030
I'll leave the Scarlet Sect.

14:47.200 --> 14:48.750
Elder, how could you have such thoughts?

14:49.790 --> 14:51.720
I've given my all to him in the Scarlet Sect,

14:52.360 --> 14:53.200
but he only ignores it.

14:54.480 --> 14:55.910
You said I wouldn't yield,

14:57.890 --> 15:00.170
but what difference did it make when I humbled myself to him?

15:02.960 --> 15:04.790
I've given him my whole heart,

15:07.600 --> 15:09.440
but have I received even a bit of sincerity from him?

15:13.550 --> 15:14.440
I'm tired.

15:16.870 --> 15:18.410
But Elder, you were born

15:18.750 --> 15:19.750
and raised in the Scarlet Sect.

15:20.600 --> 15:22.670
Where else could your home be if you leave?

15:24.170 --> 15:25.450
I still think

15:26.200 --> 15:28.080
you should tell Sovereign about this, Elder.

15:28.490 --> 15:30.840
He can't be that hard-hearted.

15:30.970 --> 15:32.350
I believe things will take a turn for the better.

15:38.000 --> 15:40.030
Cleansing swords in the Spirit Spring is a major event for the Scarlet Sect.

15:41.580 --> 15:43.030
His Lordship is fully focused on this.

15:45.040 --> 15:46.800
Let's talk about it after this matter is settled.

15:51.630 --> 15:54.200
Since the Spirit Spring caused disturbances last time,

15:54.480 --> 15:56.000
it has vanished without a trace.

15:57.220 --> 15:59.670
Yesterday, an unusual phenomenon occurred in the capital,

16:00.000 --> 16:01.840
and the Demon Detector has been acting up non-stop.

16:02.680 --> 16:03.600
As for our Eternal Sect,

16:03.630 --> 16:05.120
we've received the Crown Prince's

16:05.140 --> 16:06.380
urgent letter in his own handwriting.

16:07.200 --> 16:07.840
It turns out

16:08.600 --> 16:10.670
all the disturbances were caused by Su Yishui.

16:11.270 --> 16:11.960
So the Demon's child

16:12.270 --> 16:14.000
is actually that scoundrel Su Yishui.

16:14.720 --> 16:16.960
We've all been deceived by him.

16:35.030 --> 16:36.600
We must find the Demon's child as soon as possible.

16:36.790 --> 16:37.390
Otherwise,

16:37.510 --> 16:39.080
the universe will be thrown into chaos again.

16:39.670 --> 16:41.720
But we don't know what method he used

16:41.840 --> 16:44.200
to conceal the traces of the Spirit Spring.

16:44.960 --> 16:46.790
Even the Demon Detector can't capture it.

16:47.950 --> 16:49.030
The information

16:49.050 --> 16:51.030
that came with His Highness's letter is that

16:51.630 --> 16:53.480
the last direction where the Demon's child disappeared

16:53.960 --> 16:54.750
was the East Sea.

16:55.910 --> 16:57.030
I hereby request all sovereigns

16:57.480 --> 16:59.870
to send more disciples to search for its whereabouts.

17:03.630 --> 17:04.790
Speaking of which,

17:05.750 --> 17:07.480
I wonder how Su Yu is doing.

17:08.200 --> 17:09.109
Will Zhou Feihua

17:09.400 --> 17:10.920
be implicated?

17:12.160 --> 17:13.680
That person from the Exotic Pavilion is quite capable.

17:14.349 --> 17:15.640
He will certainly do his utmost

17:15.900 --> 17:16.710
to rescue Su Yu.

17:17.280 --> 17:18.369
But the poison is deep in his body and hard to cure,

17:18.440 --> 17:19.480
and his primordial spirit has left his body.

17:19.829 --> 17:20.630
He won't live long.

17:21.069 --> 17:22.069
As for Zhou Feihua,

17:22.369 --> 17:23.130
I've already sent messages to

17:23.160 --> 17:24.000
Yu Tong and Yu Chen,

17:24.640 --> 17:25.369
asking them to keep an eye out

17:25.400 --> 17:26.030
and protect her.

17:26.480 --> 17:27.270
Don't worry about it anymore.

17:27.720 --> 17:28.590
Grab some sleep.

17:28.790 --> 17:29.550
Rest and recuperate.

17:36.830 --> 17:37.350
Zhao.

17:37.960 --> 17:39.370
You weren't in the city a few days ago.

17:39.510 --> 17:41.200
You missed the unprecedented sight.

17:41.750 --> 17:42.710
The Green Dragon attained ascension,

17:42.790 --> 17:43.510
and phoenixes flew up to the sky together.

17:43.720 --> 17:45.360
Wasn't that an auspicious sign?

17:45.880 --> 17:47.110
You're mistaken.

17:47.590 --> 17:48.580
I have a cousin

17:48.680 --> 17:49.510
who serves in the palace.

17:50.110 --> 17:50.750
He said the Crown...

17:52.270 --> 17:53.160
He said the Crown Prince

17:53.310 --> 17:54.720
was keeping devils in the palace,

17:54.750 --> 17:56.000
which caused Heaven's wrath to descend.

17:56.480 --> 17:57.030
The Eastern Palace

17:57.090 --> 17:58.270
was mostly destroyed.

17:58.970 --> 17:59.610
The Crown Prince

17:59.640 --> 18:01.210
has even lost years of his life.

18:01.240 --> 18:03.400
Even the imperial physicians are at a loss.

18:03.590 --> 18:04.270
I'm afraid...

18:04.990 --> 18:05.760
Stop talking.

18:08.400 --> 18:09.070
Let me tell you something.

18:09.790 --> 18:10.790
His Highness is resting.

18:10.900 --> 18:11.720
He said he didn't want

18:11.720 --> 18:12.950
the moving shadows at the door to disturb him.

18:13.200 --> 18:14.690
You all step back and keep watch from a distance.

18:15.270 --> 18:15.640
Yes.

18:16.310 --> 18:16.750
Let's go.

18:54.750 --> 18:56.020
If you're so reluctant,

18:56.700 --> 18:57.990
why bother leaving?

19:00.570 --> 19:01.370
Seize her!

19:05.960 --> 19:07.110
You anticipated my arrival.

19:10.660 --> 19:11.920
I had people spread rumors in the capital

19:11.920 --> 19:13.160
in all the inns, both large and small,

19:14.310 --> 19:15.310
and near the city gates

19:15.310 --> 19:17.030
about how serious my illness is.

19:19.440 --> 19:20.640
I knew

19:21.440 --> 19:23.240
you'd return out of concern for me.

19:24.350 --> 19:25.590
You've always been soft-hearted.

19:27.030 --> 19:27.590
You're right.

19:28.400 --> 19:29.750
I was truly worried something might happen to you.

19:31.550 --> 19:32.720
But you've been scheming against me.

19:35.160 --> 19:35.750
Su Yu.

19:37.030 --> 19:37.680
I thought

19:38.830 --> 19:40.310
we had truly opened our hearts to each other.

19:41.790 --> 19:42.440
But

19:43.550 --> 19:44.750
I don't really know you at all.

19:54.380 --> 19:55.140
You scold me,

19:56.880 --> 19:58.160
yet you still care about me.

19:59.010 --> 20:00.160
Of course I don't want to see

20:00.160 --> 20:01.200
anything happen to you.

20:02.270 --> 20:03.400
I wish for your well-being.

20:04.030 --> 20:04.550
However,

20:05.210 --> 20:06.210
I'm even more unwilling to see you

20:06.240 --> 20:07.920
fall into an abyss from which you can't return.

20:17.460 --> 20:19.000
But in this world, how can anything

20:19.000 --> 20:20.510
be perfect in every way?

20:23.270 --> 20:25.160
To gain something, one must lose something.

20:29.900 --> 20:30.750
Feihua.

20:32.040 --> 20:33.640
All these years by my side,

20:35.510 --> 20:36.550
you've done well.

20:39.280 --> 20:40.080
I also understand

20:40.110 --> 20:41.880
your unspoken feelings for me.

20:43.350 --> 20:44.070
I know

20:45.720 --> 20:47.550
your feelings for me are genuine and deep.

20:50.640 --> 20:51.400
Rest assured.

20:52.440 --> 20:53.440
I won't make things difficult for you.

20:55.730 --> 20:57.040
I don't want to hear any more of

20:57.070 --> 20:58.200
your insincere words.

21:02.400 --> 21:03.830
Your heart is clearly so cold,

21:05.130 --> 21:06.170
risking the turmoil of public opinion

21:06.200 --> 21:07.070
and political stability,

21:07.360 --> 21:08.320
just to lure me into your trap.

21:09.550 --> 21:10.680
Your aim is to use me as a hostage

21:11.690 --> 21:12.730
to force Ranran to show herself, isn't it?

21:12.960 --> 21:13.480
Yes.

21:15.330 --> 21:16.090
You value emotions,

21:16.780 --> 21:17.640
and she values righteousness.

21:19.110 --> 21:20.270
You came for me.

21:21.070 --> 21:22.720
Surely she'll come for you,

21:23.750 --> 21:25.920
and Su Yishui will surely come for her!

21:32.470 --> 21:33.160
I was so stupid.

21:35.030 --> 21:36.480
I've been fooling myself for over a decade,

21:37.880 --> 21:39.720
thinking sincerity could be exchanged for sincerity.

21:42.640 --> 21:43.310
I never thought that

21:44.680 --> 21:45.510
in your eyes,

21:46.270 --> 21:47.640
I'm just a tool after all.

21:50.640 --> 21:51.760
You're using me to force Ranran to appear.

21:51.790 --> 21:52.550
But so what?

21:53.750 --> 21:54.480
With you being like this,

21:55.030 --> 21:56.270
do you think you can still win her favor?

22:03.030 --> 22:04.070
Take her to the Cold Palace!

22:12.440 --> 22:13.310
Take good care of her.

22:14.830 --> 22:15.760
Don't hurt her.

22:16.880 --> 22:17.480
Su Yu.

22:18.000 --> 22:19.340
Ranran won't fall for your trap!

22:20.000 --> 22:20.960
All that you've been planning

22:20.990 --> 22:22.030
will not succeed!

22:22.110 --> 22:23.000
Take her away!

22:23.310 --> 22:23.750
Yes, Your Highness.

22:43.200 --> 22:43.680
Look.

22:44.890 --> 22:45.520
This Concubine Zhou

22:45.550 --> 22:46.590
is truly audacious.

22:46.830 --> 22:47.970
How dare she attempt to kill the Crown Prince?

22:48.070 --> 22:48.720
Indeed.

22:49.270 --> 22:50.550
She's far too bold.

22:50.960 --> 22:51.640
So bold.

22:51.540 --> 22:52.700
[Announcement]

22:51.830 --> 22:53.270
What a pity. She's so beautiful.

22:53.750 --> 22:54.200
Let's go.

22:55.430 --> 22:58.600
[Compatible]

22:59.450 --> 23:00.590
This is the Cold Palace of the Eastern Palace.

23:00.920 --> 23:02.030
This is where Concubine Zhou is imprisoned.

23:02.720 --> 23:03.350
At present,

23:03.480 --> 23:04.440
the palace's defensive formation

23:04.460 --> 23:05.700
hasn't been fully repaired.

23:06.070 --> 23:07.070
With the use of magic,

23:07.090 --> 23:08.720
I believe entering shouldn't be difficult.

23:09.550 --> 23:11.750
But the Eastern Palace won't overlook this matter.

23:12.140 --> 23:13.490
Those cultivators from the Exotic Pavilion

23:13.520 --> 23:15.170
must have set up formations around the Cold Palace,

23:15.190 --> 23:16.360
waiting for us to fall into their trap.

23:17.530 --> 23:19.220
The Crown Prince is holding Concubine Zhou captive

23:19.250 --> 23:21.350
simply to force Guardian and Ranran to show themselves.

23:25.240 --> 23:26.510
Then we'll create a diversion.

23:27.300 --> 23:28.300
Let's split into two groups.

23:31.400 --> 23:32.740
We'll enter from here first.

23:43.550 --> 23:44.450
Su Yishui has appeared!

23:44.790 --> 23:45.640
And Xue Ranran too!

23:46.260 --> 23:46.650
After them!

23:46.880 --> 23:47.270
Yes!

23:47.720 --> 23:48.030
Hurry!

23:48.480 --> 23:48.920
Chase them!

23:54.930 --> 23:55.480
Ranran.

23:55.820 --> 23:56.850
Don't let Su Yu

23:56.880 --> 23:57.720
capture you again.

24:02.160 --> 24:02.690
I must say,

24:02.920 --> 24:04.180
this tunneling armor Baishan rushed to make

24:04.350 --> 24:04.960
is really handy.

24:08.680 --> 24:09.210
You are...

24:10.110 --> 24:10.790
I'm Yu Tong,

24:11.000 --> 24:11.960
and this is my elder brother, Yu Chen.

24:12.280 --> 24:12.690
The two of us

24:12.720 --> 24:13.880
are here on Guardian Su Yishui's orders

24:14.030 --> 24:14.750
to help you leave the capital.

24:32.550 --> 24:33.480
This feels so good.

24:33.880 --> 24:35.160
I had such a deep sleep.

24:35.750 --> 24:36.680
You slept for three days.

24:44.510 --> 24:45.200
The wounds on my body

24:45.200 --> 24:46.240
don't hurt anymore.

24:46.510 --> 24:47.310
They healed so quickly.

24:50.680 --> 24:52.350
Master, have you not rested for the past three days,

24:52.760 --> 24:53.560
using your spiritual power

24:53.590 --> 24:54.590
to heal me all this time?

24:58.030 --> 24:58.880
I don't sleep anyway.

24:59.310 --> 25:00.640
The Spirit Spring has entered my body before,

25:01.150 --> 25:02.480
so it's easier for it to reconnect with the demonic energy

25:02.510 --> 25:03.310
from the Spirit Spring in my heart.

25:04.030 --> 25:05.030
I need to stay alert at all times

25:05.350 --> 25:06.640
to prevent the Spirit Spring from taking advantage of any weakness.

25:07.110 --> 25:08.350
I can't let it hurt you again.

25:08.790 --> 25:10.790
Master, you can't relax for even a moment.

25:11.550 --> 25:12.680
Aren't you exhausted?

25:13.440 --> 25:14.510
I have entered the Transcendence Realm.

25:15.160 --> 25:16.590
Not sleeping for ten days or even half a month is no problem.

25:17.000 --> 25:17.650
Moreover,

25:18.110 --> 25:19.020
the essence of the Spirit Spring

25:19.200 --> 25:20.790
is to infinitely expand human greed

25:21.240 --> 25:22.060
and entice the devil in one's heart.

25:22.670 --> 25:23.610
But the obsession of my life

25:23.640 --> 25:24.240
is already by my side.

25:24.590 --> 25:25.880
It's difficult for the Spirit Spring to entice me.

25:26.270 --> 25:26.750
Then...

25:27.160 --> 25:28.400
If the Spirit Spring tries to entice you,

25:29.070 --> 25:30.480
Master, just hug me

25:30.510 --> 25:31.070
and kiss me,

25:31.400 --> 25:31.960
so that the Spirit Spring

25:31.960 --> 25:32.810
will have no way to succeed.

25:34.480 --> 25:35.590
You're still such a rascal.

25:36.720 --> 25:37.560
If being a rascal

25:37.590 --> 25:39.290
can make you smile happily, Master,

25:39.440 --> 25:40.720
shouldn't I be even more of a rascal?

25:41.830 --> 25:42.590
Besides,

25:43.000 --> 25:44.440
our hearts are already in sync.

25:45.640 --> 25:46.590
You're mine, Master.

25:47.690 --> 25:48.620
I can kiss you whenever I want.

25:51.920 --> 25:52.580
You're right.

25:53.030 --> 25:53.680
In that case,

25:54.350 --> 25:55.080
may I have

25:55.110 --> 25:56.110
my token of love back?

25:56.680 --> 25:57.550
Token of love?

25:59.310 --> 26:00.500
Master, you mean

26:00.520 --> 26:01.880
the wooden hairpin I made from the Divine Tree?

26:02.440 --> 26:02.920
Exactly.

26:03.440 --> 26:04.240
When you gave it to me,

26:04.550 --> 26:05.590
I was drunk and not clear-headed.

26:06.000 --> 26:06.890
I didn't know who it was from.

26:07.350 --> 26:08.030
I guessed it was you,

26:08.640 --> 26:10.550
but I missed the chance to ask you.

26:11.270 --> 26:12.680
I had kept that hairpin in my room all along,

26:13.440 --> 26:14.310
but Mu Ranwu took it.

26:14.310 --> 26:15.070
It wasn't what I intended.

26:18.160 --> 26:18.950
If this wooden hairpin

26:19.110 --> 26:20.000
gets taken

26:20.030 --> 26:20.960
by someone else again,

26:21.310 --> 26:22.350
I won't care what the reason is.

26:22.680 --> 26:23.350
I'll only hold you responsible.

26:24.920 --> 26:25.400
It won't happen.

26:26.070 --> 26:27.350
I will keep it safe and sound.

26:43.150 --> 26:43.870
Slow down.

26:45.310 --> 26:46.720
If you get hurt now,

26:47.000 --> 26:47.830
it will take a long time to heal.

26:51.830 --> 26:52.550
The wind is strong by the sea.

26:52.830 --> 26:53.440
Hold onto me.

26:54.130 --> 26:55.540
I'll channel spiritual power throughout your body.

26:55.790 --> 26:56.720
It will help you resist the wind and cold.

26:58.200 --> 26:59.070
Holding Master's hand,

27:00.590 --> 27:01.510
how could I not be willing?

27:08.030 --> 27:09.020
It's still here.

27:12.360 --> 27:13.650
We've reached the far reaches of the East Sea,

27:13.670 --> 27:14.430
the Sea of Immortality.

27:15.160 --> 27:16.720
The Divine Dragon Island is not far ahead.

27:17.110 --> 27:18.670
The Divine Dragon Island is under the jurisdiction of the Immortal Realm.

27:19.110 --> 27:20.920
It's one of the passages from the Immortal Realm to the mortal world.

27:21.480 --> 27:22.440
With the coverage of the barrier,

27:22.440 --> 27:23.720
outsiders can't see or enter it.

27:24.270 --> 27:25.200
It has divine dragon bloodline,

27:25.400 --> 27:26.110
so surely it can pass through.

27:26.590 --> 27:27.640
I told it to leave earlier,

27:27.830 --> 27:28.790
but it was reluctant to go.

27:29.880 --> 27:31.640
Why haven't you gone home yet?

27:31.920 --> 27:33.440
Have you been waiting for us all this time?

27:39.790 --> 27:41.400
How did you know I was hungry?

27:42.590 --> 27:43.880
This should be its token of gratitude.

27:44.640 --> 27:45.750
I fed it some

27:45.750 --> 27:46.750
Sanity Pills you made some time ago.

27:47.350 --> 27:48.310
This dragon fell into

27:48.310 --> 27:49.480
the hands of ill-intentioned people from a young age.

27:49.880 --> 27:50.750
They never taught it right from wrong,

27:51.320 --> 27:52.640
only hastening the maturation of its spiritual power.

27:53.110 --> 27:54.220
It inevitably developed some devilish nature.

27:54.960 --> 27:55.880
Your Sanity Pills

27:56.070 --> 27:56.920
can eliminate its devilish nature.

27:57.450 --> 27:58.210
It seems

27:58.510 --> 27:59.270
the effect is quite good.

27:59.920 --> 28:01.070
Master, you're so considerate.

28:03.200 --> 28:03.740
However,

28:03.990 --> 28:05.230
you should go home now.

28:05.720 --> 28:07.000
When you arrive home, you'll have many

28:07.000 --> 28:07.760
companions.

28:08.030 --> 28:09.750
You should spend more time with your companions

28:09.960 --> 28:11.480
and learn how to be a proper dragon.

28:11.920 --> 28:13.590
Don't fall into the hands of bad people again.

28:28.030 --> 28:29.040
If it weren't for you, Master,

28:29.630 --> 28:30.720
I'm afraid I wouldn't have been able to fulfill

28:30.750 --> 28:32.230
my promise to Dragon Mother, Meng Zhang.

28:33.110 --> 28:33.880
Thank you, Master.

28:34.640 --> 28:35.590
What you care about

28:36.070 --> 28:37.350
is what I care about.

28:38.030 --> 28:39.400
From now on, don't ever say thank you to me again.

28:42.640 --> 28:43.510
I'm really hungry.

28:43.830 --> 28:45.160
It's time to prepare a feast.

28:46.270 --> 28:46.880
However,

28:47.600 --> 28:48.560
if you keep

28:48.590 --> 28:49.400
holding my hand, Master,

28:49.830 --> 28:51.270
I won't be able to prepare the ingredients.

28:53.830 --> 28:54.750
You've just recovered.

28:55.200 --> 28:55.920
Don't exert yourself.

28:56.830 --> 28:57.160
Come on.

28:57.510 --> 28:58.110
Sit here.

29:00.420 --> 29:01.180
If you want to eat,

29:01.490 --> 29:02.140
I'll cook for you.

29:08.960 --> 29:10.310
Can you handle it, Master?

29:10.720 --> 29:11.550
Why are you doubting me?

29:12.310 --> 29:13.200
It's just cooking a meal.

29:13.350 --> 29:13.920
Is it that difficult?

29:21.170 --> 29:21.730
I...

29:21.200 --> 29:25.620
♫Gradually gravitate toward you by love♫

29:22.510 --> 29:23.480
I can use some guidance.

29:26.430 --> 29:31.520
♫Words are too weak to tell the whole story♫

29:31.540 --> 29:36.330
♫Only after I met you♫

29:36.650 --> 29:44.470
♫Did I realize there are heaven-like places all because of you♫

29:44.740 --> 29:49.760
♫Maybe a lifetime is too short, too fleeting♫

29:49.780 --> 29:55.020
♫So we were granted a second chance♫

29:55.550 --> 30:00.530
♫With endless time to write our story♫

30:00.790 --> 30:04.900
♫We fulfill the vow forged through many lifetimes♫

30:05.190 --> 30:10.550
♫From now onwards♫

30:23.720 --> 30:25.130
Master, you once asked me

30:26.160 --> 30:27.920
what kind of life I wanted.

30:29.000 --> 30:29.720
I think

30:30.350 --> 30:31.750
the life we're living now is good enough.

30:34.210 --> 30:35.820
To be with the one I love,

30:36.880 --> 30:38.440
savoring three meals a day,

30:39.510 --> 30:40.920
enjoying beautiful scenery,

30:41.740 --> 30:43.020
no need for immortality or riches,

30:43.670 --> 30:45.390
just growing old together like this. That's all I want.

30:47.830 --> 30:48.830
But there's no rush.

30:50.830 --> 30:51.920
Only when this world is at peace

30:52.320 --> 30:53.710
can my dream come true.

30:54.540 --> 30:55.930
After sealing the Spirit Spring,

30:56.440 --> 30:57.000
solving

30:57.000 --> 30:58.310
the big trouble that threatens

30:58.310 --> 30:59.110
my peaceful future,

30:59.680 --> 31:00.550
we can talk about it then.

31:02.990 --> 31:03.590
Ranran.

31:04.560 --> 31:05.520
I know you want to go with me

31:05.550 --> 31:06.270
to the netherworld.

31:07.200 --> 31:08.440
But the current condition of your Spirit Root...

31:08.640 --> 31:09.200
Master.

31:10.350 --> 31:10.880
I once said

31:10.900 --> 31:12.280
that I wanted to change to the path of talisman cultivation.

31:12.590 --> 31:13.790
It wasn't on a whim.

31:14.440 --> 31:15.680
Do you remember, Master,

31:15.960 --> 31:17.640
the technique I created by myself in the past?

31:19.350 --> 31:20.590
One wisp of qi to break the galaxy?

31:23.270 --> 31:24.160
The more I remember,

31:24.440 --> 31:25.400
the clearer I become.

31:26.000 --> 31:27.310
One wisp of qi to break the galaxy

31:27.440 --> 31:28.720
includes talisman array methods.

31:29.200 --> 31:29.920
Besides, to make it

31:29.920 --> 31:31.110
exert its strongest power,

31:31.680 --> 31:32.680
it doesn't require

31:32.680 --> 31:33.550
the primal power of the Spirit Root.

31:34.590 --> 31:35.640
The five elements of the universe,

31:36.160 --> 31:37.270
wind, rain, thunder, lightning, and mist,

31:37.760 --> 31:38.890
or metal, wood, water, fire, and earth,

31:39.510 --> 31:40.640
are all sources of power.

31:50.880 --> 31:52.590
I borrow qi from the universe.

31:53.440 --> 31:54.790
The universe enters my heart.

31:55.880 --> 31:56.720
One wisp of qi...

31:57.680 --> 31:58.680
Break the galaxy!

32:08.070 --> 32:08.880
I see.

32:09.720 --> 32:10.930
It's drawing power from nature

32:11.000 --> 32:12.070
to cultivate the original foundation.

32:12.750 --> 32:13.510
But later on,

32:13.760 --> 32:14.690
we became increasingly reliant on

32:14.720 --> 32:15.550
our own innate qualities

32:15.680 --> 32:16.640
and spiritual power talents,

32:17.510 --> 32:18.510
losing sight of what's truly important.

32:18.960 --> 32:19.800
We no longer have the energy

32:19.830 --> 32:20.960
to harness the power of nature.

32:24.200 --> 32:25.590
I'm just not very skilled at it.

32:25.960 --> 32:26.880
If I practice more,

32:27.100 --> 32:28.380
I'll definitely get better and better.

32:29.110 --> 32:29.920
The power of the universe

32:30.000 --> 32:30.720
is even more vast and endless

32:30.720 --> 32:31.750
than the primal power.

32:32.510 --> 32:33.000
Master.

32:33.510 --> 32:34.270
Believe in me.

32:34.750 --> 32:35.590
I can really do it.

32:36.110 --> 32:37.070
Of course I believe in you.

32:37.880 --> 32:39.310
So don't say things like

32:40.020 --> 32:41.540
I can't go to the netherworld anymore.

32:45.640 --> 32:46.830
The Heavenly Bottle has broken.

32:47.480 --> 32:49.310
You've been guarding against the Spirit Spring day and night without rest.

32:49.680 --> 32:50.680
It's really exhausting.

32:53.720 --> 32:54.880
Although this small island is nice,

32:55.680 --> 32:57.400
we need to go and do what's important now.

33:02.730 --> 33:03.860
Yes. It's time for us to leave.

33:07.310 --> 33:07.830
Third Prince.

33:08.440 --> 33:09.000
How dare you!

33:09.680 --> 33:10.830
I've come by His Majesty's verbal order,

33:11.400 --> 33:12.590
specifically bringing the royal

33:12.590 --> 33:13.310
physician Chen

33:13.510 --> 33:14.480
to check on the Crown Prince.

33:14.920 --> 33:15.520
How dare you

33:15.880 --> 33:16.920
obstruct us?

33:17.170 --> 33:18.930
[Jingyang Hall]

33:17.720 --> 33:18.730
Third Brother, you're here.

33:19.480 --> 33:20.610
Come on, invite him in.

33:30.960 --> 33:32.750
A few days ago, above my Eastern Palace,

33:33.110 --> 33:34.070
a dragon's shadow appeared.

33:34.490 --> 33:35.800
The news spread like wildfire.

33:35.830 --> 33:36.550
All sorts of rumors arose.

33:37.240 --> 33:39.130
The court ministers were so concerned

33:39.160 --> 33:40.030
that they frequently came to visit.

33:41.310 --> 33:42.360
I indeed have been

33:42.390 --> 33:43.190
somewhat exhausted from dealing with them.

33:43.880 --> 33:45.160
That's why I had them stop everyone who came to visit me.

33:46.000 --> 33:47.270
I didn't expect you to come today.

33:48.400 --> 33:49.600
Since Father has sent

33:49.620 --> 33:50.590
a royal physician for you,

33:51.200 --> 33:52.000
Brother,

33:52.130 --> 33:53.130
don't let

33:53.160 --> 33:54.510
Father's kind intentions go to waste.

33:55.590 --> 33:56.400
Royal Physician Chen.

33:57.480 --> 33:58.240
Please proceed.

34:05.790 --> 34:06.350
How is it?

34:13.659 --> 34:15.840
His Highness's pulse is strong,

34:16.139 --> 34:17.510
steady and powerful.

34:18.030 --> 34:19.969
It indicates abundant qi and blood,

34:20.000 --> 34:21.800
which is a sign of good health.

34:22.360 --> 34:24.360
This old servant will report back to His Majesty

34:24.500 --> 34:25.770
to put His Majesty's mind at ease.

34:25.800 --> 34:27.190
Thank you for your trouble, Royal Physician Chen.

34:28.840 --> 34:30.610
After worshiping the universe at the Imperial Ancestral Temple today,

34:31.110 --> 34:32.540
I will personally enter the palace

34:33.250 --> 34:34.420
to see Father.

34:34.929 --> 34:37.070
[Jingyang Hall]

34:40.760 --> 34:41.440
Reversal Pill.

34:42.190 --> 34:43.230
Give me another Reversal Pill.

34:43.920 --> 34:44.469
Hurry up.

34:44.800 --> 34:46.150
I've already informed Your Highness that

34:47.070 --> 34:48.000
the Reversal Pill

34:48.230 --> 34:50.210
forcefully boosts your body's vital energy

34:50.510 --> 34:52.110
at the cost of

34:52.110 --> 34:52.880
rapidly depleting it.

34:53.880 --> 34:55.960
Your Highness, you took the Reversal Pill

34:56.590 --> 34:59.400
to deal with the Third Prince's probing

34:59.440 --> 35:00.540
and pacify the people.

35:00.910 --> 35:02.220
It's already the worst strategy.

35:03.760 --> 35:05.220
Then what's a good strategy?

35:06.290 --> 35:07.980
You failed to exchange my body.

35:08.770 --> 35:10.080
As for Su Yishui and Xue Ranran,

35:10.110 --> 35:11.400
you didn't bring either of them back,

35:12.510 --> 35:14.440
and you even let Zhou Feihua be kidnapped.

35:15.360 --> 35:16.510
Tell me, what are you capable of?

35:18.150 --> 35:20.710
The disciples of Wester Sect kidnapped Zhou Feihua

35:21.150 --> 35:22.280
and immediately left the capital.

35:22.480 --> 35:23.280
Their direction was clear,

35:23.880 --> 35:26.630
which indicates they've already made contact with

35:27.280 --> 35:29.280
Su Yishui and Xue Ranran.

35:31.230 --> 35:32.500
As for the Spirit Spring,

35:33.000 --> 35:34.320
it seems it hasn't possessed

35:34.320 --> 35:35.460
Su Yishui's body.

35:36.070 --> 35:36.800
However,

35:37.530 --> 35:39.410
they'll definitely make a trip to the netherworld

35:39.710 --> 35:40.860
to return the Spirit Spring.

35:41.590 --> 35:43.000
That will be my opportunity,

35:43.510 --> 35:44.980
and Your Highness's opportunity as well.

35:46.480 --> 35:47.320
What do you mean?

35:48.090 --> 35:49.060
In the netherworld,

35:49.360 --> 35:51.290
there's an even more powerful master.

35:51.800 --> 35:53.550
He can surely subdue Su Yishui.

35:54.400 --> 35:55.880
If we can find him,

35:56.400 --> 35:57.280
then, Your Highness,

35:57.720 --> 35:59.600
you won't need to transform into a demon by the Seven Evil Transformation Spell,

36:00.190 --> 36:01.880
nor possess anyone's body.

36:02.320 --> 36:04.440
You can still achieve your wishes.

36:21.450 --> 36:24.680
[Inn]

36:33.400 --> 36:34.440
They should be arriving soon, right?

36:44.710 --> 36:45.190
You cold?

36:50.590 --> 36:51.630
No need to go through all that trouble.

36:52.920 --> 36:54.510
A simple hug will do, Master.

37:21.280 --> 37:21.960
Qingge.

37:22.590 --> 37:23.440
Feihua.

37:25.770 --> 37:27.310
Is it my ears playing tricks on me,

37:27.340 --> 37:28.500
or my eyes?

37:29.480 --> 37:30.880
What did Concubine Zhou just call Ranran?

37:31.230 --> 37:32.740
Qing... Ge?

37:33.150 --> 37:36.070
As in Qingge from the name Mu Qingge?

37:36.630 --> 37:37.110
That's right.

37:37.750 --> 37:38.880
Ranran is Mu Qingge.

37:49.000 --> 37:49.670
Su Yishui.

37:50.280 --> 37:51.400
Stay away from Qingge.

37:52.150 --> 37:52.800
Are you trying to take advantage of her

37:52.800 --> 37:53.800
loss of memories of the past

37:54.070 --> 37:55.330
to deceive her again?

37:55.960 --> 37:56.770
Feihua.

37:57.280 --> 37:57.920
Don't be like this.

37:57.920 --> 37:59.000
Master won't harm me.

37:59.440 --> 38:00.440
Besides, between me and him,

38:00.790 --> 38:01.830
I was the one who fell in love first.

38:03.720 --> 38:05.050
You don't remember

38:05.360 --> 38:06.150
what kind of person Su Yishui is.

38:06.760 --> 38:07.550
Let me remind you.

38:08.480 --> 38:09.110
At that time,

38:09.710 --> 38:10.850
on the battlefield of FanYao,

38:11.710 --> 38:12.880
I was with my father in the military camp.

38:13.670 --> 38:15.150
You came to find me, severely wounded.

38:15.480 --> 38:17.000
The Spirit Spring in your body couldn't be suppressed.

38:17.840 --> 38:18.520
You said some

38:18.550 --> 38:19.510
unconscious ramblings to me.

38:20.440 --> 38:21.760
Su Yishui is the Demon's child.

38:26.530 --> 38:27.590
You only got possessed by the Spirit Spring

38:27.630 --> 38:28.800
because you tried to save him.

38:29.190 --> 38:30.030
You're talking nonsense!

38:31.840 --> 38:32.360
Su Yishui.

38:32.880 --> 38:33.920
Even the people around you

38:33.950 --> 38:35.450
don't know your true identity?

38:36.880 --> 38:37.510
Back then,

38:38.030 --> 38:39.360
you used the pretense of

38:39.630 --> 38:41.060
eliminating evil for the greater good

38:41.420 --> 38:42.500
and caused Qingge's death.

38:43.030 --> 38:44.090
Master didn't do that.

38:44.450 --> 38:45.640
He was just mistaken

38:45.670 --> 38:46.630
and failed to rescue me in time.

38:46.960 --> 38:47.590
You believe what he says?

38:48.760 --> 38:49.670
All these years,

38:50.360 --> 38:52.110
you've allowed people to slander Qingge,

38:52.440 --> 38:53.650
calling her the Demon's child who brought calamity,

38:53.880 --> 38:55.690
yet you never clarified the truth.

38:56.320 --> 38:57.440
What else do you have to say?

38:58.070 --> 38:58.710
Qingge.

38:58.840 --> 39:00.190
You still can't see the truth?

39:03.410 --> 39:04.330
She's right.

39:09.110 --> 39:09.670
I...

39:12.670 --> 39:13.510
You didn't finish your sentence.

39:13.880 --> 39:15.360
You're not going to deny it again, are you?

39:15.840 --> 39:16.800
It's not like that.

39:27.400 --> 39:28.400
There's a spell.

39:30.750 --> 39:31.980
It's the Silencing Curse.

39:35.960 --> 39:37.760
It was me who cast it on you back then

39:39.090 --> 39:40.250
to prevent you from mentioning

39:40.280 --> 39:41.150
the truth about the Demon's child.

39:42.120 --> 39:42.970
I've always wanted to tell

39:43.000 --> 39:44.030
everyone the truth.

39:45.510 --> 39:46.230
I know.

39:46.920 --> 39:47.550
Qingge.

39:47.960 --> 39:49.190
Stop being foolish.

39:49.710 --> 39:51.230
This person doesn't deserve your trust.

39:57.000 --> 39:58.110
Master is the Demon's child,

39:58.740 --> 39:59.660
destined from birth,

39:59.880 --> 40:00.710
not by his own will.

40:01.400 --> 40:02.320
It's like the little dragon we saved

40:02.320 --> 40:03.710
in the capital,

40:04.510 --> 40:05.460
forced into existence by evil people,

40:05.630 --> 40:06.590
yet no one cared for it.

40:06.880 --> 40:07.800
That's why it developed demonic nature.

40:08.610 --> 40:09.250
If only someone

40:09.280 --> 40:10.510
had shown him a righteous path.

40:11.730 --> 40:13.160
For over a decade,

40:13.760 --> 40:14.670
until now,

40:15.360 --> 40:16.670
Master has been quietly making amends

40:18.960 --> 40:20.550
for all the past misunderstandings and mistakes.

40:21.280 --> 40:22.410
The past is already in the past.

40:23.190 --> 40:24.400
Let's all move on.

40:34.440 --> 40:34.920
Master.

40:35.670 --> 40:36.440
Go back to your room first.

40:51.110 --> 40:51.880
Feihua.

40:53.070 --> 40:54.000
You better not regret it.

40:54.590 --> 40:55.920
I never do things I'll regret.

40:59.800 --> 41:00.960
You're still the same you after all.

41:01.760 --> 41:02.760
Reliving your life,

41:03.150 --> 41:04.550
falling in love with the same person,

41:05.070 --> 41:06.000
and walking down the same path.

41:06.880 --> 41:07.360
It's as if

41:07.360 --> 41:08.400
everything was arranged.

41:13.480 --> 41:14.110
Immortal?

41:14.920 --> 41:16.470
Why is there an immortal in the netherworld?

41:19.150 --> 41:19.670
What's wrong?

41:20.760 --> 41:22.030
You said I was severely injured

41:22.030 --> 41:23.030
and unable to suppress the Spirit Spring.

41:23.710 --> 41:25.000
Who caused my injury?

41:25.760 --> 41:26.440
I asked you

41:26.840 --> 41:28.280
if it was Su Yishui who hurt you.

41:28.630 --> 41:29.400
You said it wasn't him,

41:29.800 --> 41:31.070
but you didn't tell me who it was.

41:32.510 --> 41:33.030
Oh, right.

41:33.590 --> 41:35.050
When you were babbling nonsense,

41:35.190 --> 41:36.190
I remember you said something like

41:36.590 --> 41:38.240
you wouldn't let the ending come true,

41:38.760 --> 41:39.480
as if you had already known

41:39.480 --> 41:40.150
something extraordinary

41:40.150 --> 41:41.110
would happen.

41:43.670 --> 41:44.110
By the way,

41:45.590 --> 41:46.920
this is what you asked me

41:46.920 --> 41:48.230
to get from Su Yu's study.

41:47.380 --> 41:49.610
[Xuantian Teachings]

41:50.440 --> 41:50.880
Thank you.

41:51.640 --> 41:53.210
I hope this book can be of use to you

41:53.840 --> 41:55.400
and help you find the entrance to the netherworld.

41:55.800 --> 41:57.120
If it's truly as you say,

41:58.000 --> 41:58.710
Su Yishui

41:58.920 --> 42:00.630
is willing to return the Spirit Spring to the netherworld,

42:01.000 --> 42:02.320
then it would be a blessing for the universe.

42:03.450 --> 42:04.040
Otherwise...

42:04.070 --> 42:04.710
He will.

42:05.590 --> 42:06.680
I was captured this time,

42:07.320 --> 42:08.590
and the Zhou family's property was also confiscated.

42:09.070 --> 42:11.110
Fortunately, Su Yishui had planned ahead

42:11.900 --> 42:12.780
and safely transferred my family

42:12.920 --> 42:14.090
out of the capital.

42:14.630 --> 42:15.590
For this matter,

42:16.140 --> 42:17.740
I should thank him properly.

42:18.510 --> 42:19.400
My father has taken my family

42:19.400 --> 42:20.440
to live in seclusion back in my hometown.

42:21.220 --> 42:22.860
So of course, I should go and reunite with them.

42:23.440 --> 42:24.960
It's our fault that our affairs implicated you.

42:25.550 --> 42:26.800
I'm sorry, Feihua.

42:27.840 --> 42:28.440
It's not your fault.

42:32.190 --> 42:33.110
Su Yu and I,

42:33.840 --> 42:34.710
as well as the Zhou family,

42:35.360 --> 42:36.840
would have faced this sooner or later anyway.

42:38.220 --> 42:39.820
Su Yu's ambition is the universe.

42:40.920 --> 42:41.960
Serving a ruler is like living with a tiger.

42:43.000 --> 42:43.670
Moreover,

42:44.850 --> 42:45.410
it's a

42:45.440 --> 42:47.000
vicious tiger which has been driven to desperation.

42:47.880 --> 42:48.590
Feihua...

42:51.590 --> 42:52.630
But as you said,

42:53.150 --> 42:53.920
it's all in the past now.

42:55.070 --> 42:56.220
Since he has changed,

42:57.230 --> 42:58.190
I should also let it go

42:58.920 --> 43:00.400
and live my own life.

43:02.840 --> 43:03.590
Feihua.

43:04.510 --> 43:05.510
Keep these talismans

43:05.510 --> 43:06.550
for emergencies.

43:07.150 --> 43:08.770
If there's anything you can't handle,

43:09.360 --> 43:10.480
come to Mount Wester to find me anytime.

43:12.590 --> 43:13.030
Take care.

43:14.000 --> 43:14.550
Take care.
